#2700
The Abyss~
This area (2701-2799) was written by an unknown builder. If you should happen
to know who did write it, please include them in the credits here and in the
general area listing. This is a preety dangerous area, characters coming here
should be at least 30th lvl and no one should come here alone. There are items 
here for characters of all alignments, althou the bias is towards evil.

Modified by Vex 31/12/95 for RavenMud.
~
27 0 0 0 0 1 255 0
S
#2711
Desolation~
     Standing in the perpetual noon day sun of this bleak desert like terrain, 
you find yourself wishing for the simple comforts of home that you have left 
behind. Stretched out before you in all directions, is a bleak and miserable 
terrain. Obviously once a great forest, twas long ago burned, or decimated, 
leaving behind only the charred stumps and burned ashes that you now see.  
~
27 0 0 0 0 3 255 0
D0
A road runs north leading on into a seeming infinity.
~
Iron Gate~
2 0 2712
E
inscription writing top~
     The inscription at the top of the arch reads:
			   Highway to Hell
~
E
arch grand archway~
     The rough stone arch sweeps 30 feet overhead. Once possibly a grand and 
majestic piece of  architecture, it is now much less. It's smooth, sweeping 
bands having become chipped and decrepit over the years, the inscription at 
the very top of the arch has become almost unreadable.
~
S
#2712
Highway to Hell~
     On and on, this simple dirt road runs endlessly over the terrain with no 
obvious destination in sight. The road itself seems to be well tended, if not 
well used. All bramble having been tossed off of the path, and out of reach 
from the road. The charred forest lying all around you gives off a feeling of 
regret, an ill omen that prevents you from straying off of the main highway.
~
