#2713
Highway Intersection~
     The end of the highway, lies mercifully in sight just to the north, where 
the main dirt path running north-south finally meets with a small clearing in 
these lost woods. The highway running south, however is without any distinction
other then it is the only way to travel in this accursed land.
     A smaller path intersects the highway here, heading off to the east and 
west. As you peer down the lesser roads, you see them bend to the north, not 
too far along. They obviously encircle the glade to the north.
~
