#2721
Temple of the Abyss~
     The highway ends abruptly here, in a small glade. Large stones and burnt
out trees stand guard around the perimeter, keeping safe this sacred place. 
The ground here, is a polished black marble, made to reflect the night sky
eternally. At first glance, the darkness of the surface seems perfect, but as
you look more closely, you can see small white specks  of diamond sparkling
within the surface. And after a time you come to realize that this is a
perfect model of the night sky, the small dots being the stars. However,
unlike the true celestial heavens, only the constellations of those gods of
evil are represented here. This revelation sends shivers down your spine.
~
