	  Chemosh         - Lord of the Undead
	  Zeboim          - Sea Queen
	  Hiddukel        - God of Trickery and Deals
	  Nuitari         - God of Evil Magic
	 *Takhisis        - The Queen of Darkness, DragonQueen
~
