#2723
Before the Gates~
     The tunnel, which descended from above to the south, ends here before a
large, heavy portal. The cave, lit by simple torches on either side of the
large stone doorway, seems to absorb the dancing lights of the flames, as if
torturing them. The portal itself is covered with runes and glyphs of ancient
design, and though most are illegible, the serpents and the skeletal figures
interwoven with the ominous scripts give you full warning that this gateway
leads to a less then hospitable area. A small phrase along the side of the
door appears to be written in a text that you can read.
~
