#2724
Evil's Arms~
     The moment you step through the doors into this labyrinth of tunnels
which twist and turn mercilessly into the heart of the darkness, a feeling of
loss settles over you. You turn around and look at the portal on the west wall
several times, simply to reassure yourself that it is indeed still there. That
escape is still possible. The door remains, however so does the overwhelming
hopeless feeling. Tunnels lead off to the north and the west, quickly
disappearing into darkness, and from the shadows of their openings you hear
the rustles and hushed noises of others in the caves. You are not alone.
~
