#2725
Evil's Arms~
     The caverns walls in these caves are completely smooth, as if they were
subjected to an extreme heat, melting them centuries in the past only to have
them cool into the high gloss finish. Sounds echo throughout the cavern, your
own breathing heard as clearly as a spoken voice. In the center of the room,
upon the floor lies a plaque with a single word written upon it.
~
