#2732
Evil's Embrace~
     Stepping into the room, you find yourself in the center of Evil's Arms.
Cradled in the very heart of the maze, passages lead out in the 4 cardinal
directions, letting you back into the labyrinth. However, it is what is in 
the very center of this room that catches your attention. Upon the floor is 
a carving. A circle of five serpents, each consuming the tail of the one in 
front of itself forming a complete circle. In the center of the carving, 
however, is the sword. Thrust firmly into the stone, the sword cracks the 
very floor, splintering it to the limits of the carving.
~
