The Sword's Descent~
    Chill winds of unbearable cold whip past you as you find yourself
plummeting down a pit of blackness. There is no light. As far as you can tell
your light source can only illuminate yourself, for the walls of the pit, if
there are any, are far beyond the reach of the light.
~
