#2740
The School of Darkness~
     Having penetrated the outer defenses of this temple of darkness, you
find yourself in what looks to be an initiation chamber of sorts. The rough
walls of the passageway to the north, smooth and even out into sculpted walls
of dark design. Pillars decorate the hallway, and rise into the ceiling.
Studying here are many acolytes of the dark queen, and they don't appear to
be very happy to see you.
~
