The Corridor of Cold~
    A strong, cold wind blows south through the gate to north, chilling you
to the bone. But it is more then this. The walls of this very place seem to
draw the life from your body, making you colder then you can ever remember.
The gate on the north wall almost seems to warn you, more then block your way.
~
