Halls of the Pantheon~
      You now walk the halls of the gods of evil. The chill winds that chilled
your bones, now chills your heart. For this is the very heart of evil. All
that opposes good are housed somewhere in this place. The thought makes your
heart race, and also scares you to the bone. For these gods are not ready to
be ousted from their thrones. The pit you fell down looms above, unclimbable.
~
