     The evil of this place is almost overwhelming. Although to the north, the
hallway seems structured, recognizable, once you start to penetrate this
domain, all sense of familiarity, of security is lost. The walls, twist and
mishape, blending away until all that you have is a sense of ability to move
in directions without knowing why.
~
