The Realm of Sargonnas~
    Little is known of Takhisis's consort. Perhaps the Queen of Darkness casts
intentional shadows over him. Thereby, Takhisis keeps him obscure, little
worshiped, non-threatening. He is the brooding, sometime explosive god of
vengeance, rage, deserts and volcanos. And now that you have disturbed his
plotting, he is the god that will bring about your demise!
~
