The Realm of Morgion~
     Morgion, god of disease and decay, refuses the company of the other gods
and does not discuss his plans with them. Alone, Morgion broods here or in a
bronze tower at the edge of the Abyss, keeping thoughts secret from all but
his loyal minions. Those unfortunate to encounter him, soon meet their death,
as you are about to.
~
