#2769
The Realm of Chemosh~
     In the Age of Dreams, Chemosh, lord of Undead, was drawn by Takhisis to
this realm. She needed a lieutenant to marshal the legions of death.  As lord
of false redemption, Chemosh offers 'eternal life': recipients spend
immortality in an undead and eternally corrupted body. Chemosh rarely explains
this when making a pact with Evil undead. Before they can reconsider, they 
find themselves minions of Chemosh. To you who have disturbed his rest, he 
offers only damnation.
~
