     Nuitari, god of black magic, drew his Evil nature from his parents,
Takhisis and Sargonnas. Like the other gods of magic, Nuitari left his home
plane to orbit this realm from the Ethereal plane. Now, found here in his
avatar form, he is none too happy to be disrupted in his studying.
~
