#2773
The Altar of the Dark Queen~
     The haze of evil that composes the hallways slowly coalesces into a more
solid, familiar type of terrain. Unfortunately, the relief of solid ground 
does not last long, for you find yourself in the most horrific of places 
imaginable. An altar, made of bone and gold, and serpent skin, lies blood 
stained in the center of the room. Standing in back of it is a portal, the 
likes of which you've never seen. Five dragon heads, form a circle around a 
central mirror. Each head a different color, black, white, green, blue and 
red, and each caught in act of what looks to be a scream of exquisite agony. 
Looking through the mirror, you see a land that twists and convulses, 
ever-changing, chaotic. You look upon the Abyss, the home of the Dark Queen 
herself.
~
