The Abyss~
    The abyss is a plane of sheer chaos, whose only method of madness can 
discerned by it's ruler, the Queen of Darkness. The terrain in front of your
eyes wavers even as you watch from, tropical forest, to desert, to freezing
tundra, and yet what you see never truly matches what you feel you are 
standing in. Going is difficult at best.
