The Realm of Hiddukel~
     Hiddukel, god of ill-gotten wealth and deals, is patron god of Evil 
businessmen and dishonest merchants. A cunning deal maker, Hiddukel trades in 
living souls. Some say Hiddukel can even barter with Takhisis and come out 
ahead. In fact, even now if you could check his list, he even has a deal for 
you.
~
